{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/4e81b87221e8a6889b9298e6ad8692a9.poster.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/4e81b87221e8a6889b9298e6ad8692a9.webm?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/4e81b87221e8a6889b9298e6ad8692a9.mp4?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splash color onto infinite islands to create vibrant cities. Solve placement puzzles to meet the needs of your citizens or simply place districts where you wish. No timers, no stress - \u00a0just the tranquil joy of painting your utopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/552bdf8cc8017f0979eec8a94cb8e9db.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/bc96ed8a1c3b373065aecfb77e24e45c.poster.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/bc96ed8a1c3b373065aecfb77e24e45c.webm?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/bc96ed8a1c3b373065aecfb77e24e45c.mp4?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is your canvas. No complex systems. Simply select a district from your color palette and brush it across the land, instantly turning your strokes into bustling city districts. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/835f419df9fb46b155815472c8ad2da7.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/a7a24b15a21ca7c0fbd3ff0123d3e608.poster.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/a7a24b15a21ca7c0fbd3ff0123d3e608.webm?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/a7a24b15a21ca7c0fbd3ff0123d3e608.mp4?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover four distinct biomes to set down your roots - Temperate, Arctic, Tropical &amp; Arid. Where will you build your utopia?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/20db9cd1c8dfd5f16b4f9b547dc858ba.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/14fd9245bad60145afe6a8835a27dbdd.poster.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/14fd9245bad60145afe6a8835a27dbdd.webm?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/14fd9245bad60145afe6a8835a27dbdd.mp4?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new canvas, every time. Never paint the same picture twice. Our procedural engine generates unique island layouts combining 5 different terrain features - Mountain, River, Lakes, Woodlands &amp; Wetlands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/834db07cf80c3dcc09e4487e1d78705e.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/6f4f93046b6e38ae1c5737b3bd95fc47.poster.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/6f4f93046b6e38ae1c5737b3bd95fc47.webm?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/6f4f93046b6e38ae1c5737b3bd95fc47.mp4?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just paint - immerse yourself in the world of Palettopia. Watch weather systems roll across your city and discover the local wildlife inhabiting each biome. It\u2019s not just a city builder; it\u2019s a digital terrarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>What Palettopia Offers:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8\u00a0Intuitive City Painting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9\u00a0Harmonious Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f\u00a0Infinite Replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728\u00a0Creative Freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>What Palettopia Does Not Offer:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f\u00a0Combat or Violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc9\u00a0Stressful Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3\u00a0Timers or Pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0b\u00a0Volcanic Eruptions (\u2026yet) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Palettopia is lovingly inspired by games like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islanders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dorfromantik</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Glade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Townscaper</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c A Note from the Team:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Palettopia</i>\u00a0is  crafted by a small team of friends and family united by a passion for video games, art, and creativity. Together, we aim to share the joy and wonder of building beautiful things with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are pouring our hearts into this, and your support means the world to us. We hope our little island builder brings you a moment of joy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3004170?t=1771015675","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/98576d6ed776e1c4f8635fb62e8c8213aa7e1fbf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771015675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/e2ad165bece877556d121c34a970bde83e699926/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771015675","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/e2ad165bece877556d121c34a970bde83e699926/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771015675","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}