extras/bc96ed8a1c3b373065aecfb77e24e45c.mp4?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is your canvas. No complex systems. Simply select a district from your color palette and brush it across the land, instantly turning your strokes into bustling city districts. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/835f419df9fb46b155815472c8ad2da7.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/a7a24b15a21ca7c0fbd3ff0123d3e608.poster.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/a7a24b15a21ca7c0fbd3ff0123d3e608.webm?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/a7a24b15a21ca7c0fbd3ff0123d3e608.mp4?t=1771015675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover four distinct biomes to set down your roots - Temperate, Arctic, Tropical &amp; Arid. Where will you build your utopia?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/20db9cd1c8dfd5f16b4f9b547dc858ba.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/14fd9245bad60145afe6a8835a27dbdd.poster.avif?t=1771015675\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as