><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9\u00a0Harmonious Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f\u00a0Infinite Replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728\u00a0Creative Freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>What Palettopia Does Not Offer:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f\u00a0Combat or Violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc9\u00a0Stressful Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3\u00a0Timers or Pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0b\u00a0Volcanic Eruptions (\u2026yet) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Palettopia is lovingly inspired by games like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islanders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dorfromantik</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Glade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Townscaper</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c A Note from the Team:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Palettopia</i>\u00a0is  crafted by a small team of friends and family united by a passion for video games, art, and creativity. Together, we aim to share the joy and wonder of building beautiful things with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are pouring our hearts into this, and your support means the world to us. We hope our little island builder brings you a moment of joy!</p>","developers":["Oh Wow Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/f49b4a22338a9d4ab847caaa6e6245a2a8859982/header.jpg?t=1771015675","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> NA</li></u